 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "shockwave-triggers-335466@major-2025-10-23",
   "gameId": "shockwave-triggers-335466",
   "displayName": "1st Update After Release - YEAY",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-23T18:28:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey Pilots,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks a lot for the support!! I hope you guys are enjoying Shockwave Triggers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to your awesome feedback and bug reports, I've been working on the game the whole time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Beside fixed the bugs you've reported, I've also added some quality of life features:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Start / Escape to close the dialogue scene. It was Y / Triangle before, which was problematic in case the player maps \"special attack\" to that key.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new option to totally remove the cutscene before and after bosses.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44988312/9c00a9709438c390a8bd2e6da90d13b862090c37.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new option to turn off the majority of voices. Previously, it was just the announcer voice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44988312/b2ee4829c30ce1a22b1479e91ade1052ac18d498.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The continue message now uses the keys \"start / escape\" to select \"no\". Previously it was \"B\", which cause players to in-intentionally select no continue while they still have credits left.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That was everything for this first patch. I'll be counting on your support for further improving of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you guys enjoyed it, please consider leaving some positive reviews, the game really needs some.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shinu Real Arts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
