  {
   "id": "shockwave-triggers-335466@7",
   "gameId": "shockwave-triggers-335466",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 7",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-16T16:15:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi there pilots,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Recently, I've got a huge feedback from the community and been busy working on that. Alongside the regular bug fixes, I've got the following changes done, hoping they improve the over all quality of the core gameplay:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players do not lose all their power ups after a hit, they only get down by 1 level, but lose all turrets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Continue now reduces score to 0.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enemies bullets colors changed to match backgrounds and player fire.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Slowing down some enemy bullets on stage 01.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turbo B no longer can shoot and charge at the same time. Which was a bug that removed the risk: purpose of his play style.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cool down for Turbo B special is now faster.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turbo B gets invincibility after creating a Shockwave, just like Amira",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The horizontal horizontal scrolling of the backgrounds is improved for better bullets tracking.: Thanks again for the feedback and support! I hope these changes improve the game.: Right now work on stage 5 is going smoothly.: Cheers,: Shinu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
