  {
   "id": "shockwave-triggers-335466@major-2024-09-14",
   "gameId": "shockwave-triggers-335466",
   "displayName": "REGULAR GAME UPDATE",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-14T16:13:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi there pilot,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is just a regular game update. For this new patch 1.1.5, as usual, a few bugs were fixed. But also I decided to make things difficulty-wise spicier for stage 1. This decision was made after regular demands from players. If you guys find the game too challenging, you can still lower the difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope that the game now offers a challenging but also fair gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As for the game progress in general. Work already started on stage 4 and it's 20% so far:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "However, I decided to pause working on stage 4 and started working on something the game needed since day one: An intro!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I guess this is the overall progress and update so far.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
