  {
   "id": "shockwave-triggers-335466@patch-2024-08-18",
   "gameId": "shockwave-triggers-335466",
   "displayName": "Regular bug fixes patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-08-18T17:26:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi there pilot,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is a demo patch for version 1.1.4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is just regular update fixing bugs you've been reporting, which I truly appreciate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Main bug fixes and changes in this version",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Auto special (bomb) is now available for all difficulties. You can turn it on/off from the options. I'll add more twists to this later.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Boss 1 core is no longer damage-able until it shows its HP and starts attacking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Too bad, but it was removed. Some player discovered the \"I\" key that I didn't block for the demo, which triggers the continue screen any time and allows players to have many characters on screen. Was fun to watch hahaha.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "HUD bug during the intro screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "And other minor fixes.: That was all for this patch. Otherwise, progress is getting smoothly and stage 3 is near being done.: Cheers,: Shinu Real Arts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
