  {
   "id": "shockwave-triggers-335466@6",
   "gameId": "shockwave-triggers-335466",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-08-01T17:35:33.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello pilots,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As the title mentions, the new patch 1.1.1 brings some changes to the core system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've been getting a lot of feedback on the item/power ups drop system. The old system was part randomized and part checking the player's state in order to drop the necessary items. However, players didn't like this method, so I want with the traditional take and created item carriers that disposes power ups, add-ons, bombs etc. at certain parts of the stage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I also added a bonus drop at the end of each stage to help players start the next stage with some fire power in case they've lost them during the boss fight.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, I did some optimization for both players so none overpowers the other.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other than that, so minor bugs are fixed, namely the new achievements for boss 02.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With that, I4ll be taking my leave and resume working on stage 3.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
